  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.8 - [FIX] GROUP BY with aggregates: SELECT with keys only (exact, case-insensitive match) + aggregate expressions, with AS alias when the column differs from the property (42803 on PostgreSQL; Dapper did not materialize the key). v1.4.6 - [FIX] ParseEntityPaged accepts groupAttributes (GROUP BY + aggregates on paged queries; rescue from data-toolkit-init branch). v1.4.5 - [FIX] GroupBy with aggregates: SELECT with keys + expressions only. [PERF] EntityReflector with cache. [DOCS] README in 5 languages. Data.Specification reference via NuGet (1.6.3). v1.4.4 - Build/pack normalization. v1.0.0 - Parser/reflector extraction from DapperRepository 1.9.5.",
